      "text": "User\n{\n    id: PK\n    accbirth:\n    followers:\n    postCount:\n    isCelebrity:\n    etc..\n}\n\nPost\n{\n    id: PK\n    userId: FK\n    blobUrl:\n    createdOn:\n    modifiedOn:\n    status: FAILED/SUCCESS/PENDING/DELETED\n }\n\nrelationships are stored\nas adj. lists with UserId\nas nodes. (a <-> b edges)",
      "fontSize": 20.464382440024373,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "User\n{\n    id: PK\n    accbirth:\n    followers:\n    postCount:\n    isCelebrity:\n    etc..\n}\n\nPost\n{\n    id: PK\n    userId: FK\n    blobUrl:\n    createdOn:\n    modifiedOn:\n    status: FAILED/SUCCESS/PENDING/DELETED\n }\n\nrelationships are stored\nas adj. lists with UserId\nas nodes. (a <-> b edges)",
