      ],
      "updated": 1791637046842,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "pulls the new posts (non-\nceleb) and creates a timeline\nof 100 posts in batches and\nstores them in the cache.\n\nread svc picks the fyp from\nthere.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "pulls the new posts (non-celeb) and creates a timeline\nof 100 posts in batches and stores them in the cache.\n\nread svc picks the fyp from there.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "hn-cn9jIH9JLrtmD3fBkf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1589.707947061204,
      "y": 665.983777724963,
      "width": 532.3604037295418,
      "height": 319.85902373043774,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0F",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1912518879,
      "version": 932,
      "versionNonce": 5466815,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791633953006,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Note:\nFeed Service only computes feeds with non-\nceleb posts.\nCeleb posts are fanned out only when\nfollowers open the app and request feed. its\non-demand not pre-computed to prevent\nload on servers.\n\nFeed service can run a recommendation engine\nto create fyp by recency (user interactions,\nrecent follow) and rank by relevancy",
      "fontSize": 23.262474453122746,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Note:\nFeed Service only computes feeds with non-celeb posts.\nCeleb posts are fanned out only when followers open the app and request feed. its on-demand not pre-computed to prevent\nload on servers.\n\nFeed service can run a recommendation engine to create fyp by recency (user interactions, recent follow) and rank by relevancy",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
